W("Read: 'On pads of velvet quiet, / In his quiet rage.' Why is the word 'quiet' repeated?", 3, "To stress both the soft silence of the tiger's steps and the silent, controlled anger inside him. The repetition makes the anger felt more deeply. (3)", "M"),
